01:26:08.045 --> 01:26:10.945
Kira-kira... setinggi ini.

01:26:12.969 --> 01:26:14.969
Lalu?

01:26:18.993 --> 01:26:21.993
Anu, itu berlendir seperti ikan lumpur.

01:26:22.917 --> 01:26:23.917
Berlendir?

01:26:23.941 --> 01:26:27.941
Ya. Lengket juga.

01:26:28.965 --> 01:26:31.965
Berlendir dan lengket.

01:26:32.989 --> 01:26:34.989
