01:26:38.913 --> 01:26:40.913
Warna utamanya itu...

01:26:40.937 --> 01:26:42.937
hijau.

01:26:51.961 --> 01:26:53.961
Kau nyari mati?

01:26:53.985 --> 01:26:55.985
Apa?

01:26:56.009 --> 01:27:00.909
Kau kira ini bercandaan,
