01:31:06.973 --> 01:31:08.973
Apa mereka itu raksasa?

01:31:09.997 --> 01:31:11.997
Memangnya seberapa besar mereka?

01:31:20.921 --> 01:31:22.921
Ada 6 kursi,

01:31:22.945 --> 01:31:24.945
