01:31:28.969 --> 01:31:32.969
Tak pernah naik pesawat,
sekarang aku di pesawat angkasa.

01:31:34.993 --> 01:31:36.993
Jangan sentuh apa-apa.

01:31:37.917 --> 01:31:39.917
Taruh.

01:31:53.941 --> 01:31:55.941
Turun sini.
Jangan sentuh apa-apa.

01:31:55.965 --> 01:31:57.965
Bentar.
/ Turun sini.

01:31:57.989 --> 01:31:59.989
Ayo turunlah.

01:32:00.013 --> 01:32:02.013
Lihat ini...

01:32:02.037 --> 01:32:03.037
Turunlah, sialan.

01:32:03.061 --> 01:32:05.061
Hey, jangan sentuh itu!

01:32:05.985 --> 01:32:06.985
