01:32:07.009 --> 01:32:09.009
Apaan ini?

01:32:16.933 --> 01:32:18.933
Ada sesuatu di bawah sana.

01:32:18.957 --> 01:32:19.957
Apa?

01:32:19.981 --> 01:32:21.981
