01:33:06.997 --> 01:33:08.997
Agak berantakan.

01:33:18.921 --> 01:33:20.921
Tempat apa ini?

01:33:23.945 --> 01:33:25.945
Ayo sini.

01:33:26.969 --> 01:33:28.969
Hati-hati kalau jalan.

