/ Bentar.

01:40:09.953 --> 01:40:11.953
Tidak, tidak.

01:40:11.977 --> 01:40:13.977
Kaki mereka sama.

01:40:14.001 --> 01:40:16.901
Lihat pergelangan kakinya nekuk disini.

01:40:22.925 --> 01:40:26.925
Ya Tuhan, kau benar.

01:40:26.949 --> 01:40:29.949
Kaki mereka sama.

01:40:35.973 --> 01:40:37.973
Sialan.

01:40:44.997 --> 01:40:49.997
